# Hello! Im Guney, this is my code for the Prevalence Induced Concept Change Experiment from the study by Levari et al. 2018.
# The code is made to be run in PsychoPy v2025.1.1 and it has full instructions on each section as to where to put each block of code.

# The prevalence of the blue dots changes for each block. Meaning we have to change the values accordingly in the begin routine sections.
# The prevalence has 5 different values (0.5, 0.4, 0.28, 0.16, 0.06) I've changed them in each block so you dont have to. 
# Don't forget to set dots' appearences to "set every repeat"

